###  https://lvlupcodex.github.io/medical-device-risk-ontology/ontology#ClassIII
:ClassIII rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                   :RiskClass ;
          rdfs:comment "MDR risk class III, usually associated with high-risk medical devices."@en ;
          rdfs:label "Class III"@en ;
