###  https://lvlupcodex.github.io/medical-device-risk-ontology/ontology#ClassIIb
:ClassIIb rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                   :RiskClass ;
          rdfs:comment "MDR risk class IIb."@en ;
          rdfs:label "Class IIb"@en ;
